<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>ko</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>StepUp</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleLocalizations</key>
	<array>
		<string>ko</string>
		<string>en</string>
		<string>ja</string>
		<string>zh-Hans</string>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_PACKAGE_TYPE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>CADisableMinimumFrameDurationOnPhone</key>
	<true/>
	<key>StepUpSupabaseUrl</key>
	<string>$(STEPUP_SUPABASE_URL)</string>
	<key>StepUpSupabaseKey</key>
	<string>$(STEPUP_SUPABASE_KEY)</string>
	<key>StepUpAttesterUrl</key>
	<string>$(STEPUP_ATTESTER_URL)</string>
	<key>GIDClientID</key>
	<string>$(GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID)</string>
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>$(GOOGLE_IOS_URL_SCHEME)</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>BGTaskSchedulerPermittedIdentifiers</key>
	<array>
		<string>com.stepupcrew.stepup.upload</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>processing</string>
	</array>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>러닝 경로와 거리를 기록하고, 함께 뛰기 대기실에서 출발 준비를 확인하려고 위치를 써요. 러닝을 하지 않을 때는 위치를 기록하지 않아요.</string>
	<key>NSMotionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>러닝 중 걸음 수를 세어 거리와 기록에 쓰려고 동작 정보를 써요.</string>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIColorName</key>
		<string>LaunchBackground</string>
	</dict>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIUserInterfaceStyle</key>
	<string>Automatic</string>
</dict>
</plist>
